/*
 * codegen.gray:  C code generation for the self-hosted compiler. Walks the
 * type-checked AST and emits the C translation unit, built as a list of text
 * fragments joined once at the end.
 *
 * Author:  Marshall A Burns <marshallbcodes@gmail.com>
